& [Why]
  + generated selected-version schemas convert a previously abstract blocker into exact executable incompatibility evidence
  + running initialize despite the missing denied-read control would violate the no-run-on-missing-precondition rule
  + an independent NotRun verifier makes that refusal executable reproducible and adversarially testable without synthetic trials

& [SmallestSurface]
  + one read-only module one export one stdout CLI two focused tests and checked evidence with no dependency delta or process surface

& [ProductValue]
  + Cantor now distinguishes prepared host availability from governed host suitability and carries an exact upgrade requirement rather than silently weakening duties
